### 1. Create a room with recurring availability (Mon-Fri, 09:00-18:00)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Conference Room A",
  "capacity": 10,
  "location": "Floor 1, Building B",
  "description": "Main conference room with projector",
  "availabilities": [
    {"day_of_week": 1, "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00"},
    {"day_of_week": 2, "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00"},
    {"day_of_week": 3, "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00"},
    {"day_of_week": 4, "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00"},
    {"day_of_week": 5, "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00"}
  ]
}

### 2. Create a room with specific date availability
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Small Meeting Room",
  "capacity": 4,
  "location": "Floor 2",
  "availabilities": [
    {"specific_date": "2026-07-28", "start_time": "10:00", "end_time": "16:00"}
  ]
}

### 3. List all rooms (paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?page=1&page_size=10

### 4. Get room details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### 5. Get available slots for a room (unix timestamps)
# from = 2026-07-27 00:00:00 UTC = 1785110400
# to   = 2026-07-31 00:00:00 UTC = 1785456000
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/availability?from=1785110400&to=1785456000

### 6. Book a room
# 2026-07-28 10:00:00 UTC = 1785232800
# 2026-07-28 11:00:00 UTC = 1785236400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "start_time": "2026-07-28T10:00:00Z",
  "end_time": "2026-07-28T11:00:00Z"
}

### 7. Try double-booking (should fail with 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "start_time": "2026-07-28T10:30:00Z",
  "end_time": "2026-07-28T11:30:00Z"
}

### 8. List bookings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings

### 9. List bookings filtered by room and date range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings?room_id=1&from=1785110400&to=1785456000

### 10. Cancel a booking
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1

### 11. Book outside availability (should fail with 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "start_time": "2026-07-28T20:00:00Z",
  "end_time": "2026-07-28T21:00:00Z"
}

### 12. Cancel non-existent booking (should fail with 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/999

### 13. Create room with no availability (should fail with 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid Room",
  "capacity": 5,
  "availabilities": [
    {"start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "17:00"}
  ]
}

### 14. Create room with invalid availability time (should fail with 400)
# "25:99" is not a valid HH:MM — rejected instead of silently normalized
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad Time Room",
  "capacity": 5,
  "availabilities": [
    {"day_of_week": 1, "start_time": "25:99", "end_time": "17:00"}
  ]
}

### 15. Create room with duplicate name (should fail with 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Conference Room A",
  "capacity": 5,
  "availabilities": [
    {"day_of_week": 1, "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "17:00"}
  ]
}
